		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Ogre-height, but a mere outline of a lanky-armed humanoid form. The head resembles a sea angler fish.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15, <strong>HP</strong> 39, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 bite +5 (2d6) and 2 claw +5 (1d8 + grab) or devour soul, <strong>MV</strong> double near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +3, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +0, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> +4, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 8</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Devour Soul</strong>. Devour the soul of a grabbed creature. CON 15+ or creature dies as soul is sucked out and gobbled, daemon regains 3d6 HP.</p><p></p><p><strong>Grab</strong>. STR 15+ or held. STR 15+ on turn to break free.</p><p></p><p><strong>Great Evil</strong>. Only damaged by silver or magical sources.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
